    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make dynamite rice. Inspired by the popular dynamite sushi roll, this recipe uses sushi rice and is an easy, foolproof way to cook seafood. Chef John demonstrates how to cook the rice and add seasoned vinegar to make it sushi rice. Then he shows how to add toasted sesame seeds, bonito flakes, and nori seaweed to the rice before gently mixing them in. The dish is topped with spicy mayonnaise made with soy sauce, sesame oil, and sriracha sauce. This savory and spicy rice recipe is a great side dish at the dinner table!",
